Tanjafetch is a configuration for fastfetch that uses fastfetch with the TanjaOS logo and colors.
This is not a seperate fetch utility, package, or script.

To install tanjafetch, follow these instructions:

1) Give exucution permissions to install.sh
-> chmod +x install.sh

2) Execute install.sh to install tanjafetch
-> ./install.sh

Thats it! For more information, please contact saffron.msk@gmail.com
